  "2026-09-24T08:44:40.347Z","harness:codex","Fresh Semgrep p/ci scan with 14 rules on .github/dependabot.yml: zero findings after explicit seven-day cooldowns for both ecosystems; the three-day configuration reproduced both findings. pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities across all severities. Gate negative controls reject missing, short, malformed and bypassed declarations, and live configuration/static wiring are tested."
  "2026-09-24T08:58:02.259Z","harness:codex","Verification: PR #1295 hosted coverage artifact from run 35977528916 has exact 100/100/100/100: lines 62249/62249, statements 65109/65109, functions 13498/13498, branches 49725/49725, zero skipped counters. Four linked item suites pass. Initial local broad run exposed two now-corrected script contract expectations and a load-related census timeout; all 64 focused rerun tests passed without loosening timeouts."
  "2026-09-24T09:15:48.329Z","harness:codex","Validated CodeRabbit threads 4091860038 and 4091860048. Official GitHub documentation limits cooldowns to 1-90 days; repository policy now enforces 7-90 inclusive for default and semver fields, requires both npm and GitHub Actions updater entries, and tests removal plus 90/91-day boundaries. Initial negative controls failed before the fix. No policy threshold or coverage gate was weakened."
